{"unit_id":"Stellight__dsh-imggen#card-zh","repo":"Stellight/dsh-imggen","commit":"9c884b9d3055018d7888e0d467b8e29fb6a4ab66","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imggen 是面向 DSH Web 的文生图插件，在 Host 注册 generate_image 工具，并把图片卡片、控制选项和历史画廊接入客户端。它可通过 Pollinations 或 OpenAI 生成方形、横向或纵向图片；卡片展示提示词和图片，支持下载或新标签页打开。历史画廊可浏览、删除和清空记录，提供者选择会同步到 Host。适合希望在聊天中生成插画、海报或概念图的用户。Pollinations 默认无需密钥；OpenAI 需要配置 OPENAI_API_KEY 或 DSH_OPENAI_API_KEY。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:176-201","dsh/client.js:149-240","dsh/client.js:244-306","dsh/client.js:309-361"]}
{"unit_id":"Stellight__dsh-imggen#card-en","repo":"Stellight/dsh-imggen","commit":"9c884b9d3055018d7888e0d467b8e29fb6a4ab66","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-imggen adds image generation to DSH Web through a Host tool, using Pollinations or optional OpenAI. Result cards show images and download links; a gallery stores results for browsing or deletion. Provider tabs sync the choice. Pollinations needs no key; OpenAI requires one.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:176-201","dsh/client.js:149-240","dsh/client.js:244-306","dsh/client.js:309-361"]}
