{"unit_id":"Stellight__dsh-imggen#feature-1","repo":"Stellight/dsh-imggen","commit":"9c884b9d3055018d7888e0d467b8e29fb6a4ab66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imggen 的功能「对话文生图」：模型调用 generate_image，将提示词发送给 Pollinations 或 OpenAI 并返回图片地址。可选方形、横向或纵向尺寸，并指定模型及 Pollinations 种子。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:133-201"]}
{"unit_id":"Stellight__dsh-imggen#feature-2","repo":"Stellight/dsh-imggen","commit":"9c884b9d3055018d7888e0d467b8e29fb6a4ab66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imggen 的功能「图片卡片与下载」：生成结果会在工具卡片中展示图片、提示词和模型信息，并提供下载按钮及新标签页打开链接。图片加载失败时卡片显示提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:149-240"]}
{"unit_id":"Stellight__dsh-imggen#feature-3","repo":"Stellight/dsh-imggen","commit":"9c884b9d3055018d7888e0d467b8e29fb6a4ab66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imggen 的功能「图片历史画廊」：客户端自动把生成结果的 URL、提示词和元信息保存在浏览器本地历史中。通过卡片的历史按钮打开画廊，可查看缩略图并删除单条记录或清空历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/client.js:42-64","dsh/client.js:185-197","dsh/client.js:244-306"]}
{"unit_id":"Stellight__dsh-imggen#feature-4","repo":"Stellight/dsh-imggen","commit":"9c884b9d3055018d7888e0d467b8e29fb6a4ab66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imggen 的功能「后端切换」：输入框旁的 Pollinations 与 OpenAI 选项卡可设置默认图片服务，选择保存在浏览器并通过同源路由同步给 Host，模型提示词据此说明默认提供者。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:22-37","dsh/index.js:221-240","dsh/client.js:309-339"]}
{"unit_id":"Stellight__dsh-imggen#caveat-1","repo":"Stellight/dsh-imggen","commit":"9c884b9d3055018d7888e0d467b8e29fb6a4ab66","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imggen 使用前须知：图片提示词会发给所选的外部图片服务；默认 Pollinations 使用 image.pollinations.ai，切换 OpenAI 会把提示词发送至 api.openai.com。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:92-96","dsh/index.js:133-149"]}
{"unit_id":"Stellight__dsh-imggen#caveat-2","repo":"Stellight/dsh-imggen","commit":"9c884b9d3055018d7888e0d467b8e29fb6a4ab66","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imggen 使用前须知：OpenAI 后端需通过 DSH 凭证库或 OPENAI_API_KEY、DSH_OPENAI_API_KEY 环境变量提供密钥；未配置时该后端无法生成图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:60-83"]}
